{"id":"n27141-2-7","stage":3,"title":"고정 · 固定","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n27141-2-7-1","ko":"책장이 자꾸 저절로 넘어가서 독서에 방해가 돼.","zh":"书页老自己翻过去，影响阅读。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"책장이","meaning":"书页","explanation":"책장：书页；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"책장","audio":"/audio/0aedd7a678ca8a1d1244.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78696","senseId":"1","lemma":"책장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"책장이","audio":"/audio/ad640f480948c510a753.mp3"}},{"text":"자꾸","meaning":"一直，总是","explanation":"자꾸：一直，总是。","readings":[{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70796","senseId":"1","lemma":"자꾸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}},{"text":"저절로","meaning":"自然而然地，油然而生地","explanation":"저절로：自然而然地，油然而生地。","readings":[{"term":"저절로","audio":"/audio/b19437138a62d970739b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25019","senseId":"1","lemma":"저절로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저절로","audio":"/audio/b19437138a62d970739b.mp3"}},{"text":"넘어가서","meaning":"翻阅，翻","explanation":"넘어가다：翻阅，翻；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"넘어가다","audio":"/audio/c8ec62583dd73fe6463e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65551","senseId":"5","lemma":"넘어가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넘어가서","audio":"/audio/841c00020b5b1babeab5.mp3"}},{"text":"독서에","meaning":"读书","explanation":"독서：读书；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"독서","audio":"/audio/65842003806ebef2a058.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48896","senseId":"1","lemma":"독서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"독서에","audio":"/audio/4764f1e05e6575a04942.mp3"}},{"text":"방해가","meaning":"妨碍，干扰","explanation":"방해：妨碍，干扰；가：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"방해","audio":"/audio/f06ff098a37b7817d7ff.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15489","senseId":"1","lemma":"방해","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"방해가","audio":"/audio/e653f0666c650486cd29.mp3"}},{"text":"돼.","meaning":"变得，弄得","explanation":"되다：变得，弄得；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"16","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돼","audio":"/audio/9a156a11ed02d98f483a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"0aedd7a678ca8a1d","term":"책장","zh":"书页","audio":"/audio/0aedd7a678ca8a1d1244.mp3","entryId":"78696","definition":"构成书籍的一页页纸张。","pronunciation":["책짱"]},{"id":"d28ff63a0382ce4f","term":"자꾸","zh":"一直，总是","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3","entryId":"70796","definition":"多次连续地。","pronunciation":["자꾸"]},{"id":"b19437138a62d970","term":"저절로","zh":"自然而然地，油然而生地","audio":"/audio/b19437138a62d970739b.mp3","entryId":"25019","definition":"不借助别的力量而自动地；或不费力气而自然地。","pronunciation":["저절로"]},{"id":"c8ec62583dd73fe6","term":"넘어가다","zh":"翻阅，翻","audio":"/audio/c8ec62583dd73fe6463e.mp3","entryId":"65551","definition":"纸或书页等被翻过去。","pronunciation":["너머가다"]},{"id":"65842003806ebef2","term":"독서","zh":"读书","audio":"/audio/65842003806ebef2a058.mp3","entryId":"48896","definition":"阅读书籍。","pronunciation":["독써"]},{"id":"f06ff098a37b7817","term":"방해","zh":"妨碍，干扰","audio":"/audio/f06ff098a37b7817d7ff.mp3","entryId":"15489","definition":"干涉、阻碍事情的顺利进行。","pronunciation":["방해"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"变得，弄得","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"达到某种情况或状态。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0b048ad20942fa40c80b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n27141-2-7-2","ko":"볼펜으로 고정을 해 봐.","zh":"用圆珠笔压住试试。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"볼펜으로","meaning":"圆珠笔","explanation":"볼펜：圆珠笔；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"볼펜","audio":"/audio/4ba73c1f13e77796fb2e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59469","senseId":"1","lemma":"볼펜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"볼펜으로","audio":"/audio/9501ac85ebbd312f2d98.mp3"}},{"text":"고정을","meaning":"固定","explanation":"고정：固定；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"고정","audio":"/audio/8a98dfb08e979200599a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27141","senseId":"2","lemma":"고정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고정을","audio":"/audio/0c8e18575fd6c42b4e21.mp3"}},{"text":"해","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐","audio":"/audio/fdcffec86114c54dd4e0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"4ba73c1f13e77796","term":"볼펜","zh":"圆珠笔","audio":"/audio/4ba73c1f13e77796fb2e.mp3","entryId":"59469","definition":"笔尖的小钢珠随着笔的移动一起滚动、同时带出墨水来写字的一种书写工具。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"8a98dfb08e979200","term":"고정","zh":"固定","audio":"/audio/8a98dfb08e979200599a.mp3","entryId":"27141","definition":"在一个地方不移动；或使不移动。","pronunciation":["고정"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c887cbbb4576e8dbb5d0.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.809,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=27141","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.or